# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase (browser online multiplayer — WebRTC signaling). Optional.
# Supabase Project Settings > API. Use the public anon key only.
# Never put a service_role key in a browser env file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Steam (desktop / Electron build). Read by the Electron MAIN process only —
# NOT bundled into the renderer, so no VITE_ prefix.
#
#   SIGN99_STEAM_APP_ID  Your Steamworks App ID. During development, before you
#                        have your own appid, leave this blank to fall back to
#                        480 (Valve's public "Spacewar" test app) so lobbies and
#                        P2P work end-to-end. See docs/STEAM_MULTIPLAYER.md.
#   SIGN99_STEAM_EAGER   Set to 1 to call SteamAPI_Init at launch instead of
#                        lazily when the player opens the Multiplayer menu.
#
# Do NOT commit a real App ID secret or any Steamworks Web API key here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SIGN99_STEAM_APP_ID=
SIGN99_STEAM_EAGER=
